{'symbol': 'CRM', 'date': '2023-03-08 16:05:00', 'title': 'WIX ANNOUNCES CHANGES TO BOARD OF DIRECTORS TO SUPPORT NEW PHASE OF VALUE CREATION', 'text': "GAVIN PATTERSON , PREVIOUSLY OF SALESFORCE AND FRANCESCO DE MOJANA, PREVIOUSLY OF PERMIRA, TO JOIN WIX'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS NEW YORK , MARCH 8, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WIX (NASDAQ: WIX), TODAY ANNOUNCED CHANGES TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS. THE ANNOUNCED CHANGES ARE PART OF WIX'S TRACK RECORD OF REGULARLY REFRESHING AND ENHANCING ITS BOARD TO CLOSELY ALIGN WITH THE CHANGING OPERATING ENVIRONMENT AS WELL AS ITS CURRENT STRATEGIC OBJECTIVES, BALANCING STABILITY AND EXPERTISE WITH CHANGE AND ADAPTABILITY."}